Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:02:49.46,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 辛辛那提 WTA1000 1/8决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:02:49.46,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}凯斯 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}7-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}6(3) {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}6-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}4{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 王曦雨 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.84,0:00:04.12,EN,,0,0,0,,Madison Keys makes it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.84,0:00:04.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,凯斯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.12,0:00:06.44,EN,,0,0,0,,through to the quarterfinals once again
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.12,0:00:06.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,再次杀进这里的1/4决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.44,0:00:07.72,EN,,0,0,0,,in Cincinnati.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.44,0:00:07.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,辛辛那提
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.72,0:00:11.32,EN,,0,0,0,,The former champion finding her way past
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.72,0:00:11.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,这位辛辛那提前冠军淘汰了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.32,0:00:18.60,EN,,0,0,0,,the Chinese qualifier Wong Xiu 7664.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.32,0:00:18.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,中国资格赛选手王曦雨 7-6 6-4
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.60,0:00:20.92,EN,,0,0,0,,She certainly had to work for it though.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.60,0:00:20.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,她确实费了不少力气
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.92,0:00:22.84,EN,,0,0,0,,But work she did and found a route
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.92,0:00:22.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,但她找到了办法
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.84,0:00:24.20,EN,,0,0,0,,through in straight sets.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.84,0:00:24.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,直落两盘拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.20,0:00:25.48,EN,,0,0,0,,She'll be very pleased with that I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.20,0:00:25.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,她应该会很满意
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.48,0:00:27.48,EN,,0,0,0,,would imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.48,0:00:27.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,我猜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.48,0:00:33.48,EN,,0,0,0,,now awaits either Selk or Arena Sabalena
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.48,0:00:33.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,下轮对手是萨卡里或萨巴伦卡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.48,0:00:36.60,EN,,0,0,0,,in the quarterfinals.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.48,0:00:36.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,二者之一
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.60,0:00:38.36,EN,,0,0,0,,Maddie, congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.60,0:00:38.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,麦迪 恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.36,0:00:40.44,EN,,0,0,0,,You You were incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.36,0:00:40.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,你太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.44,0:00:40.92,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.44,0:00:40.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,我是说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.92,0:00:43.56,EN,,0,0,0,,obviously this place brought the love,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.92,0:00:43.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,这里的球迷给了你很多爱
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.56,0:00:44.76,EN,,0,0,0,,but you brought the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.56,0:00:44.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,但你带来了斗志
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.76,0:00:45.80,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, to see you fight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.76,0:00:45.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,看你最后那段
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.80,0:00:46.92,EN,,0,0,0,,at the end was incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.80,0:00:46.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,拼得太不可思议了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.92,0:00:49.00,EN,,0,0,0,,What were you most happy with tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.92,0:00:49.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,今晚你最满意哪一点？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.00,0:00:50.84,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, obviously getting down
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.00,0:00:50.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,一开始
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.84,0:00:52.20,EN,,0,0,0,,to break early in that first set,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.84,0:00:52.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,第一盘早早被破发
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.20,0:00:53.88,EN,,0,0,0,,just trying to get that back as quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.20,0:00:53.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,就想着尽快追回来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.88,0:00:54.52,EN,,0,0,0,,as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.88,0:00:54.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,越快越好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.52,0:00:55.88,EN,,0,0,0,,And I mean, she played great.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.52,0:00:55.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且她打得真的很好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.88,0:00:58.12,EN,,0,0,0,,So, really just trying to hang
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.88,0:00:58.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我就想着守住
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.12,0:01:00.52,EN,,0,0,0,,on and keep the lead and then as soon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.12,0:01:00.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,保持领先
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.52,0:01:02.28,EN,,0,0,0,,as I lost it, just trying to get it back
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.52,0:01:02.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,一旦丢了就赶紧追回来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.28,0:01:03.32,EN,,0,0,0,,as quickly as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.28,0:01:03.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,越快越好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.32,0:01:05.88,EN,,0,0,0,,And obviously it's so easy to play here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.32,0:01:05.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,在这里打球特别轻松
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.88,0:01:07.56,EN,,0,0,0,,when you have amazing fans
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.88,0:01:07.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,有这么棒的球迷
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.56,0:01:09.80,EN,,0,0,0,,and you have the crowd cheering for you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.56,0:01:09.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,全场都在为你加油
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.80,0:01:10.84,EN,,0,0,0,,and getting you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.80,0:01:10.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,帮你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.84,0:01:14.36,EN,,0,0,0,,through the tough moments.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.84,0:01:14.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,撑过那些艰难时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.36,0:01:17.56,EN,,0,0,0,,It is your first WTA 1000 quarterfinal
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.36,0:01:17.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是你本赛季第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.56,0:01:18.44,EN,,0,0,0,,of the season.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.56,0:01:18.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,打进WTA1000的1/4决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.44,0:01:21.56,EN,,0,0,0,,You have done so much in the sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.44,0:01:21.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,你在这项运动里已经拿到很多
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.56,0:01:24.12,EN,,0,0,0,,What matters to you most at this stage?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.56,0:01:24.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,到了这个阶段 你最看重什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.12,0:01:25.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Is it the joy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.12,0:01:25.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,是快乐吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.00,0:01:26.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Is it a certain number of wins?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.00,0:01:26.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,还是胜场数？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.68,0:01:29.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Is it a certain caliber of trophies?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.68,0:01:29.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,还是奖杯的分量？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.72,0:01:31.64,EN,,0,0,0,,What motivates you most?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.72,0:01:31.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,什么最能激励你？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.64,0:01:32.60,EN,,0,0,0,,I think the biggest thing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.64,0:01:32.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得最重要的一点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.60,0:01:34.68,EN,,0,0,0,,is that I'm still out here and I'm still playing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.60,0:01:34.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,是我还在这里 还在打
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.68,0:01:35.96,EN,,0,0,0,,some really good tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.68,0:01:35.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且打得真的不错
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.96,0:01:38.44,EN,,0,0,0,,I started quite a long time ago
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.96,0:01:38.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,我出道已经很久了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.44,0:01:40.20,EN,,0,0,0,,at this point, but being able
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.44,0:01:40.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,但还能够
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.20,0:01:43.24,EN,,0,0,0,,to come back and still be competitive
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.20,0:01:43.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,回来之后依然有竞争力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.24,0:01:45.16,EN,,0,0,0,,and it's really just putting myself
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.24,0:01:45.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是不断把自己
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.16,0:01:46.84,EN,,0,0,0,,in these positions to go deep
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.16,0:01:46.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,放到这样的位置上打得更深
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.84,0:01:47.80,EN,,0,0,0,,in these big events
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.84,0:01:47.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,在这些大赛里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.80,0:01:50.52,EN,,0,0,0,,and just kind of remind everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.80,0:01:50.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,也算是提醒大家
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.52,0:01:52.76,EN,,0,0,0,,that everyone calls me a veteran,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.52,0:01:52.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,都叫我老将
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.76,0:01:55.32,EN,,0,0,0,,but I can still play some good tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.76,0:01:55.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我照样能打好球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.32,0:01:57.24,EN,,0,0,0,,And just kind of reminding myself
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.32,0:01:57.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,也是提醒我自己
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.24,0:02:00.40,EN,,0,0,0,,of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.24,0:02:00.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.00,0:02:03.08,EN,,0,0,0,,After a win like this, like what
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.00,0:02:03.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,赢了这样一场之后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.08,0:02:05.16,EN,,0,0,0,,does a night look like for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.08,0:02:05.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,你今晚会怎么过？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.16,0:02:06.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Is it you relax?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.16,0:02:06.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,放松一下吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.84,0:02:08.04,EN,,0,0,0,,You're going to watch a show?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.84,0:02:08.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,看部剧？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.04,0:02:08.92,EN,,0,0,0,,Are you going to get
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.04,0:02:08.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,会去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.92,0:02:12.44,EN,,0,0,0,,in the comments regarding the podcast,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.92,0:02:12.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,看播客底下的评论吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.44,0:02:14.12,EN,,0,0,0,,a burger with everything on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.44,0:02:14.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,还是吃个加满料的汉堡？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.12,0:02:16.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Like, what does celebration look like
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.12,0:02:16.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,你的庆祝方式
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.84,0:02:17.80,EN,,0,0,0,,for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.84,0:02:17.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,是什么样的？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.80,0:02:19.96,EN,,0,0,0,,You know, I think it's wrapping up
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.80,0:02:19.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,大概就是收个尾
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.96,0:02:21.96,EN,,0,0,0,,the kind of business end of the day
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.96,0:02:21.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,把该做的事做完
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.96,0:02:25.32,EN,,0,0,0,,with some recovery and then I like to I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.96,0:02:25.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,做点恢复训练 然后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.32,0:02:27.24,EN,,0,0,0,,the queen of being asleep by 10 o'clock,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.32,0:02:27.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我可是十点就睡觉的女王
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.24,0:02:30.12,EN,,0,0,0,,so we have a little bit of time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.24,0:02:30.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以还有点时间
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.12,0:02:31.80,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I'm going to be on a tight schedule
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.12,0:02:31.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我得抓紧时间
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.80,0:02:33.64,EN,,0,0,0,,to try to get in bed by my bedtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.80,0:02:33.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,争取按时上床
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.64,0:02:35.64,EN,,0,0,0,,But just kind of wind down
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.64,0:02:35.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是放松下来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.64,0:02:37.64,EN,,0,0,0,,and enjoy the win.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.64,0:02:37.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,享受这场胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.64,0:02:40.92,EN,,0,0,0,,Try to fall asleep and hopefully get a full 8
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.64,0:02:40.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,争取睡个八
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.92,0:02:43.32,EN,,0,0,0,,to 9 hours of sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.92,0:02:43.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,九个小时
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.32,0:02:45.08,EN,,0,0,0,,Wow. We could all learn from this level
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.32,0:02:45.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,哇 这份自律
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.08,0:02:45.72,EN,,0,0,0,,of discipline.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.08,0:02:45.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们都该学学
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.72,0:02:46.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Show some love for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.72,0:02:46.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,把掌声送给
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.68,0:02:49.46,EN,,0,0,0,,Quarterfinalist Madison Keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.68,0:02:49.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,1/4决赛选手 凯斯
